Janet

This is a stratification option that is seldom exercised so I can't swear that all daemons have been exorcised from this section of code.

I've done a scan of our Github issues for occurrences of "effort_sum". I see no mention of it in any open issues. Most activity around this dates back to June 2021, when there were several code modifications and the issue was closed. This form of stratification was disabled in December 2022 when used in conjunction with multiple detection functions.

My memory does not bring to mind any more recent discussions or activity regarding "effort_sum".
